 <LayoutItem labelText="Bank-attached PALS will be constructed by placing woody pieces from one bank angled towards the other at 30-60 degrees. These structures will generally cover 60-80% of the active channel. No reinforcement materials (cobble, gravel, soil, etc) will be used in the construction of bank-attached PALS; only vegetation from local sources." visibility="1" htmlState="0" frame="false" marginY="0" zValue="41" id="" opacity="1" size="10.6412,1.45042,in" type="65641" templateUuid="{4f3ffb5c-6a35-4d49-9873-89671857b882}" halign="1" referencePoint="0" outlineWidthM="0.3,mm" marginX="2" frameJoinStyle="miter" itemRotation="0" valign="32" uuid="{4f3ffb5c-6a35-4d49-9873-89671857b882}" position="13.2606,10.4339,in" blendMode="0" positionOnPage="13.2606,10.4339,in" excludeFromExports="0" groupUuid="" background="false" positionLock="true">
